 "corpus": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
 "rows": [
  {
   "id": "sample_1600",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "Kinuba was *pretty* popular, enough that Motorball fans might not take it too well when they found out Vector was behind his jacking. ....",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1600.wav",
   "human_seconds": 8.62,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1600__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1600__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1605",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "Vector replied. \u201c*He\u2019ll* be fine, they\u2019ll pick him up and take care of him. .... Now will you get the *hell* out of here *already*?\u201d",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1605.wav",
   "human_seconds": 8.18,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1605__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1605__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1613",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "\u201cNo,\u201d *Vector* said with a small laugh, \u201cwhat you should have known, my friend,",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1613.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.32,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1613__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1613__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1626",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "Iron City itself had come into existence not long after the arduous era of *bureaucracy* ...",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1626.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.56,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1626__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1626__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1628",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "it had just worked out that way. .... Of course, while most of them weren\u2019t *idiots*, none of them understood the *nature* of their *existence* well enough to be as *appreciative* as they could have been.",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1628.wav",
   "human_seconds": 11.9,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1628__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1628__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1635",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "which was supposed to elicit feelings of *pride* and contentment. .... Unfortunately, assumptions of *victory* had been slightly *premature*.",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1635.wav",
   "human_seconds": 9.22,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1635__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1635__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1636",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "The gate had been badly damaged in the final attack, during the War that no one knew very much about any more. ...",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1636.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.62,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1636__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1636__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1642",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "In the backseat, Koyomi seemed to have dozed off ... while Tanji was wide awake and as *sour* faced as ever.",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1642.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.86,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1642__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1642__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1654",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "Alita barely ... dared to breathe. .... It stuck its *brutal* machine head through Hugo\u2019s window and scanned them. .... A hundred years later,",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1654.wav",
   "human_seconds": 9.58,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1654__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1654__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1683",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "Alita thought again of the Earth as she had seen it. \u201cI hope not.\u201d ... The fields began to alternate with wooded areas before finally giving way to them altogether.",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1683.wav",
   "human_seconds": 12.68,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1683__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1683__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1689",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "Biological warfare ruined the world.\u201d \u201c*The* *whole* *world*?\u201d Alita asked, appalled.",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1689.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.54,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1689__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1689__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1690",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "Tanji and Koyomi nodded in unison. .... \u201c*You* think people would stay in Iron City if there was anywhere else to go?\u201d",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1690.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.24,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1690__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1690__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1697",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "\u201c*This* is it,\u201d Hugo announced, bringing the truck to a stop and killing the motor. .... \u201cThis is as far as we can drive.",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1697.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.44,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1697__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1697__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1699",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "She heard a cry and looked up to see a hawk circling above the trees. .... \u201c*It\u2019s* free out here,\u201d",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1699.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.14,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1699__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1699__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1716",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "was at least *half* a *mile* across, fed by a turbulent waterfall on the right hand edge. .... But it wasn\u2019t a naturally occurring lake",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1716.wav",
   "human_seconds": 8.88,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1716__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1716__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1719",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "But it was the *unbelievably* massive object itself that dominated the scene. .... The spacecraft sat partially submerged in the centre of the lake,",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1719.wav",
   "human_seconds": 10.28,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1719__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1719__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1735",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "There.\u201d .... \u201c*How* does she know?\u201d Koyomi asked just as Tanji said, \u201c*What* does she mean, we",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1735.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.34,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1735__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1735__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1738",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "I vote no to swimming.\u201d .... Still smiling, Alita stepped off the hull, plunging feet first into the dark water.",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1738.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.4,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1738__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1738__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1767",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "Their uniforms had rotted away and their bones were covered with various kinds of *moulds* that flourished in the tropical humidity. ....",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1767.wav",
   "human_seconds": 8.12,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1767__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1767__clone.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "sample_1774",
   "book": "warm_baritone_30s_m_1",
   "text": "Have we met? ... she asked it silently. .... Were you in the black sky above me",
   "human_wav": "ab_test_runtime/decontaminate/batch4/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/data/val/sample_1774.wav",
   "human_seconds": 7.04,
   "lora_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1774__lora.wav",
   "clone_wav": "ab_test_runtime/second_english_eval/warm_baritone_30s_m_1/sample_1774__clone.wav"
  }
